    "$doc": [
      "What the published bake is, which script/publish.ts uploads as the",
      "bucket's `source` for the kernel to read at boot (pxl-kernel io/source.rs),",
      "in the shape the dev tile server answers too (pxl-geo-bake bin/serve_tiles.rs):",
      "",
      "`top_zoom`: the coarsest zoom of the pyramid it supplies whole, where the",
      "client's floor is held (pxl-kernel layer/residency/floor.rs).",
      "",
      "`kind`: each kind's published version, `path`, `v<format>.<date>.<n>`, and",
      "the shards it holds, `shard`, as its set's manifest named them when it was",
      "published. A published folder is immutable, so a cache never holds a tile",
      "another replaced and going back is naming the folder before.",
      "",
      "`override`: a kind's path for a shard and the tiles under it, over its",
      "kind's, written by hand.",
      "",
      "The upload says each kind's `path` and its `format`, read off the name; and",
      "as `shard` the shards every kind holds, four siblings written as their",
      "parent, with each override's `path`. A tile no key is over or under is",
      "never asked for."
    ],
